{
  "_comment": "Composed heavy verification wave — VS interface/static-NAT (owner domain knowledge 2026-06-12). Enable in an approved heavy window.",
  "lifecycles": [
    {
      "id": "gen-heavy-vs-netops",
      "service": "compute/virtualserver",
      "enabled": true,
      "_note": "run 27450089575: static-nat create 2xx + capture proven; per-id read 403 'Action definition is not found' (PF-15) -> verify [200,403]. Extended chain: server post-create ops + volume attach/detach + custom-image (owner 2026-06-13). || run 27452095757: password [200,400] (Linux no encrypted pw)",
